msgctxt "80"
msgid "No way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "You ready to come along now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Argh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "So what were you doing here, anyway? Who were you after?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Nobody. I'm just here to relax."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Don't lie to me. Why would you come here if you weren't\r\n"
"planning a hit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "I'm not lying. I come here whenever I get the chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Why on Earth would you come to a place like this unless you\r\n"
"had good reason to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"I get scared... I don't like being cooped up in places\r\n"
"that don't have a view of my surroundings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Scared? Did something happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"I blew an important mission. Completely destroyed my hitman\r\n"
"rep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"I was trying to shoot between buildings. I was sure I\r\n"
"could do it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"But I botched it. And it was a shot I couldn't afford to\r\n"
"miss..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Ever since, I've had this strange, uneasy feeling whenever\r\n"
"I'm in a place that doesn't have a wide-open view."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Sniper post-traumatic stress, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Yeah, something like that. Anyway, just think about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"This place has a clear view, sure. But do you really think I\r\n"
"could hit a target from here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Probably not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Exactly. So there's no way I could be after anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"I've been coming here a lot lately. Guess I'm not acting\r\n"
"much like a hitman these days..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I see. Guess you're not really a bad guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"But you still have information we need, so you're going\r\n"
"with me to the HLA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"What do you want? Go away. I don't feel like talking to\r\n"
"people right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "You must be Shu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "How do you know my name? Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "I'm with the Honest Living Association."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "The HLA, huh... I went to them for help once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"I'm not looking for work right now, though. Could you leave\r\n"
"me alone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"I'm not here to offer you work. I'm here to find a hitman\r\n"
"who works for the Reapers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to play games with you. Will you come with\r\n"
"me to the HLA's headquarters?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Did you really think it would be that easy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "I'm prepared to use force if I have to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "You'll regret it if you try."
msgstr ""

